{
    "pr_body": "Field level security was interacting in bad ways with the can-match phase on frozen tier shards (interaction between `FieldSubsetReader` and `RewriteCachingDirectoryReader`). This made can-match phase fail, which in the normal case would result in extra load on the frozen tier, and in the extreme case (in interaction with https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/51708) made searches fail.\r\n\r\nThis is a bug that was indirectly introduced by #78988.\r\n\r\nCloses #82044",
